{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_010_03_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:27d6fd712d6da0a21ebc85c7da7cbfc60c70dcc860e81c985e52506717999639",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000030:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efd0c1d1ba0909d205414cbfd507449e85a92920bb3e0ea684013d939d7cb79d",
      "text": "户外活动当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a3670f061e6874c7449d295548c983837a55cc9fc065c455a534ebc02af217a",
      "text": "让您久等了，这是活动限定的蛋糕☆\n……下一位客人，请点单！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b17a9d44827449aff124ab5cb4c57fd8e07faf47cc249c78fa1744cfdc25d6a",
      "text": "蛋糕和红茶套餐两份对吧。\n好的。马上为您准备！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000072:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a88b56d9a86b4f2ef0a0fbd1594057ac78265e8ebd8d0093dfae25f4074e0ad",
      "text": "户外活动结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e2dc5a84b85ae339bb9bca1dcfafac900f5ead457fb03dc89881092b6a452f7",
      "text": "大家辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c372bdc05cc97ba38b9d7d755187e6a44847dae83b20f8054e1104f81caa04a",
      "text": "辛苦啦！\n啪噼地大获成功呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48727eb64a6cc05ae90515629c7c57b56b136496cd36ecb1a097b39a5e68f2af",
      "text": "嗯！既让大家体会到了蛋糕的美妙，\n又给很多人带去了笑容，太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b58ae592e0cdcedcfd529a6cf4b1a1e80f7a7e3b275a1c7901492cb095e78b3",
      "text": "那么，差不多该准备撤场了吧。\n阿斯兰先生那边能麻烦你一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:215973e44e35bf74b1981ab3dc7f1d48765ed1c8eff8d326dd8c155867e88156",
      "text": "唔，若凭借吾之魔力，\n化为虚无易如反掌！啊——哈哈哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffad5bbe63978f48a7cab5fd037b8b0eea0f8a32e05259cf3d93f3b0162dfd2e",
      "text": "好了，等这里的收拾工作结束之后\n就去活动本部……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00ec1c9d3b9cfa5cd47dd7de51b1e4f483b69ec626b1604e3253661e26bad044",
      "text": "工作打扰了，非常抱歉。\n请问现在稍微耽搁片刻可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad2fd45ba82d6d10b46dbe1dd0c6e432b4602bf788d92529b3ef5bb1854b6ff4",
      "text": "可以的，没问题哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c8c38d37a52f2373476f7d8854a2b30f153202ad5e900fc50ce07ebc0bccae9",
      "text": "非常感谢。我是315 Production\n这家偶像事务所的制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ea24cb37b068901f1391d25e121a5f2736c461078d4fbea16f2bd2a480831c0",
      "text": "虽然有些冒昧，大家要不要试着参加\n偶像的试镜呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2f35998eddc592bb6dd7aec0377802365e184a57cbbf71558d8929a7507825e",
      "text": "哎？试镜？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bbad5f3c33290614cf1a6ae0afc2f7aba3244188718a44121fc506ebb41d705",
      "text": "是的！其实我之前就耳闻过\nCafe Parade各位的评价……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000175:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:481f6f6e179e88065449351c4a451703fbf7b65e2a4ca20bb71de29ee4d48d01",
      "text": "今天亲眼看到各位大放异彩的模样，我确信了。\n从各位身上，我感受到了作为偶像的可能性！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000178:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac548465a0e10d65bc9521cfff761e285752d08debf400331477ae9d009595ed",
      "text": "这是我的名片和关于试镜的传单。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000181:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc9550326048f8e69033a09b3c1204cbe7f07d76c7c097eedbe7f7ee3eeb0e26",
      "text": "不用立刻答复也没关系。\n请务必考虑一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_j:cmd-000187:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a56b1c9704070c3c93963a8f6ea9b1390cdaf60295024042daff3a3f16863ea",
      "text": "我们去当……偶像？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
